<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Rugby union-Auckland and Natal look classy.</title>
<headline>Rugby union-Auckland and Natal look classy.</headline>
<byline>Andy Capostagno</byline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-04-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>New Zealand's Auckland Blues lead South Africa's Natal Sharks by a point at the top of the Super 12 table after both teams scored impressive wins in the sixth round of matches on Saturday.</p>
<p>Natal were 33-15 winners over Waikato in New Zealand, while Auckland put on a pedigree display to thrash fancied visitors Australian Capital Territories (ACT) 41-9.</p>
